    <briefdescription>
<para>Comprehensive audit event for task execution. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Captures all relevant information for compliance and security monitoring:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Unique identification (UUID)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Temporal data (timestamp, duration)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Task context (ID, type, trigger)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Actor information (user, IP, session)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Result data (success/failure, error details)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Resource metrics</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Anomaly detection scores </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
